  "insufficient_evidence": false,
  "issue": "对列表去重时需要保持各元素首次出现的顺序。例如 [4,2,4,1] 应当得到 [4,2,1]；空列表仍返回空列表，输入列表不能被修改。元素均可哈希。",
  "patch": {
    "content": "{\r\n  \"api.py\": {\r\n    \"from\": \"def unique_values(values):\\n    return list(set(values))\",\r\n    \"to\": \"def unique_values(values):\\n    seen = set()\\n    result = []\\n    for value in values:\\n        if value not in seen:\\n            seen.add(value)\\n            result.append(value)\\n    return result\"\r\n  }\r\n}",
    "path": "patch/patch.json",
    "sha256": "cc7b74aa290d1369703f55b88d01ee03303a7e6d96bab85107a1a818dacef623"
